"_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le05ob04re2img06.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le05ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le05ob04re2img06.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le05ob04re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hello there, my name is Vanessa. What a lovely child! Unfortunately, other restaurant patrons are concerned about the noise. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Five year olds are always noisy. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, while I appreciate that your child has a lot of energy, you had better call your child back to your table.  He is now running through the kitchen."}, {"time": "27000", "image": "engenn6le05ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Maybe this restaurant ought to think about having an area for children to burn some energy.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Madam, this is a fine restaurant. I must make a stand here. Please control your child. We have booster seats available for him to sit at the table."}, {"time": "43000", "image": "engenn6le05ob04re2img06.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Female Customer</span>: Hey, that little boy just grabbed my purse and stomped on my foot!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: The people in our restaurant deserve to have their meals in peace.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: This place is too strict. We're leaving ... Charlie!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I would also advise you that screaming for your child in a crowded restaurant is not appropriate either.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Customer</span>: Give the bill. I don't want to stay.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Certainly ... That might be a good idea. You can pay at the front. Have a lovely evening."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "